      hu: ["Vaimosóban található", "A függetlenségi mozgalom emléke", "Az elesett vezetők előtt tiszteleg", "Fontos nemzeti emlékhely"],
      ro: ["Situat în localitatea Vaimoso", "Comemorează mișcarea de eliberare", "Onorează liderii căzuți", "Punct de reper național important"],
      en: ["Located in the village of Vaimoso", "Commemorates the Mau movement", "Honors fallen movement leaders", "Important national landmark"],
